---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import CodeBlock from "../../components/CodeBlock.astro";
import { groups } from "../../data/settings";
---
<DocsLayout title="Settings" section="settings" summary="Every page of the settings center, what it changes and where the preferences are stored.">
  <div class="doc-callout"><p><strong>Open Settings from the gear in the panel</strong>, from the dashboard, or with <code>lunadashctl open-settings appearance</code>. Changes apply immediately; sliders apply when you release them.</p></div>
  <nav class="doc-toc" aria-label="On this page">{groups.map(group => <a href={`#${group.id}`}>{group.name}</a>)}<a href="#default-apps">Default apps</a><a href="#saved">Where preferences live</a></nav>
  {groups.map(group => <section id={group.id}><h2>{group.name}</h2><p>{group.description}</p><ul>{group.details.map(detail => <li>{detail}</li>)}</ul></section>)}

  <h2 id="default-apps">Default applications</h2>
  <p>Super+T and Super+E start the configured terminal and file manager (Kitty and Dolphin by default). Change them with the control command:</p>
  <CodeBlock label="DEFAULT APPLICATIONS" code={'lunadashctl default-apps \'{"terminal":["foot"],"files":["nautilus"]}\'\nlunadashctl launch-default terminal'} />

  <h2 id="saved">Where preferences live</h2>
  <p>Shell preferences (panel, dock, clock, glass …) are stored by SlintLu under <code>~/.local/state/slintlu/</code>. Desktop preferences that the compositor applies (accent, gaps, blur, window opacity, tiling mode, night light, wallpaper folder) live in <code>~/.config/LunaDash/desktop-preferences.json</code> and can also be changed from scripts:</p>
  <CodeBlock label="CHANGE DESKTOP PREFERENCES" code={'lunadashctl appearance \'{"accent":"#c4b5fd","gap":16,"tilingMode":"scroll"}\'\nlunadashctl tiling-mode toggle'} />
  <p>The <a href="../api/">control API</a> lists every command.</p>
</DocsLayout>
